12:27.680 --> 12:29.690
Ke bawah.

12:29.870 --> 12:30.540
Sinikah?

12:30.560 --> 12:31.280
Bukan.

12:31.690 --> 12:32.260
Sini, betul.

12:32.260 --> 12:32.660
Okey.

12:32.960 --> 12:34.090
- Sini, kan?
- Betul.

12:34.550 --> 12:35.260
Gerak ke kanan.

12:35.260 --> 12:36.080
Betul.

12:36.150 --> 12:36.960
Sinilah!

12:36.990 --> 12:37.530
Sinilah.

12:41.430 --> 12:42.590
Gerak ke depan.

12:46.500 --> 12:47.160
Api.

12:47.340 --> 12:47.860
Api.

12:47.880 --> 12:48.670
Api.

12:52.960 --> 12:53.970
Saya dah dapatkannya.

12:53.970 --> 12:55.700
Bertahanlah, pusing ke depan.

12:58.930 --> 12:59.840
Hisaplah.

13:25.620 --> 13:26.270
Ada orang dibunuh!

